
  - Added agent presence statuses: Offline, Available, Break, OnCall,
    WrapUp.
  - Added presence fields to users: presence_status, presence_changed_at,
    last_heartbeat_at.
  - Added API endpoints:
      - GET /api/Agents/me/presence
      - PATCH /api/Agents/me/presence
      - POST /api/Agents/me/heartbeat
  - Frontend now sends heartbeat every 30 seconds while logged in.
  - GetNextContactAsync now only gives contacts to Available agents.
  - Assigning a contact moves the agent to OnCall.
  - Qualifying a contact moves the agent to WrapUp.
  - Stale heartbeat marks agents Offline.
  - Break/Offline/logout now release assigned contacts.
  - 30-minute untouched assigned contacts are automatically released.